index 0000000..3ddb280
--- /dev/null
+++ b/releasenotes/notes/fix-delay-since-first-attempt-statistics-5c1e9a0d3b7f2e48.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+---
+fixes:
+  - |
+    The ``delay_since_first_attempt`` key is now present in ``statistics`` from
+    the start of each run, with value ``0`` until a delay has occurred. Previously
+    the key was only added after the first retry, so reading
+    ``statistics["delay_since_first_attempt"]`` during the first attempt raised
+    ``KeyError``.
